{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他先不急着想两人以后会怎样，只想先享受眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"以后会怎样\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他提醒自己不必指望回应，也不总查看反应，便能安心靠近、自在关心对方，还觉得自己这样挺好。\",\n      \"key\": \"安心靠近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"那时他真觉得，只要能这样自然地亲近对方，眼下已经够了。\",\n      \"key\": \"眼下已经够了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他没把握以后还能一直这样亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"一直这样亲近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他想把心意多给一点，最后还是留了余地。\",\n      \"key\": \"留了余地\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂缓考虑未来的选择，把它落到先享受眼前的亲近；由S01-3提供前因，不再把还说不清怕什么当成谨慎的唯一解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\", \"R8\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不指望回应、少查看反应、自在关心，以及对自己能这样相处的满意；删去重复的放下提防和普遍道理式总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\", \"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-3保留他真觉得眼前亲近已经足够的满足，作为后来期待增长的前提；S02-4不再复述盼时间慢下来的感受，改写为没把握这种亲近能否持续，以解释B2的时间感和B4尚未失去便已舍不得的惆怅。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"补入\",\n      \"why\": \"v6没有解释B5里热切为何退回；保留想多给又留余地的变化，并以S01-2的跨段箭头提供原因，不直接复述珠子的声音变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "012b5f87-c10d-4239-bf1c-6b240cbd21db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T163144034531Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1048.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T16:49:12.677629+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a65a376e6f51791d4c6174b89fae7a70de39fb0f2d51ce79473a2426bffb7000", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T163144034531Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "624afe5834c7c128a1f88e93c77120ead3a5d693dad9a7f84a81de5910a62df2"}}